   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ordering something",
     "texto": [
      "To order, you can say **Kawę poproszę**: **kawa** changes to **kawę**. We also say **Wodę, proszę**; **woda** changes to **wodę**.",
      "To order tea: **herbatę**. These are direct object forms, even though English doesn't change the word."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With or without milk",
     "texto": [
      "After **z** («with») comes **mlekiem**; after **bez** («without»), **mleka**. In these examples the form of the word for milk changes."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Price and a false friend",
     "texto": [
      "**Ile kosztuje?** means «How much does it cost?». After **pięć** («five»), you say **złotych**.",
      "**Menu** means «menu»; **rachunek** means «the bill», not «the account»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
